WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.662
A quick word on how the
workbook itself works.

2
00:00:02.662 --> 00:00:06.972
It's twenty topic books, the newest
a draft on information protection,

3
00:00:06.972 --> 00:00:11.886
numbered along the same dependency chain
the program follows: identity first,

4
00:00:11.886 --> 00:00:16.800
then the estate's infrastructure, then
the boundary, assurance and operations.

5
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.215
Every book asks the same four
questions, why, what, who and how,

6
00:00:21.215 --> 00:00:25.450
so once you know one, you can
find your way around any other.

7
00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.195
And each topic has one home; for example,

8
00:00:28.195 --> 00:00:31.713
The Transformation Arc
owns the phases and gates.

9
00:00:31.713 --> 00:00:33.750
Statements come in three kinds.

10
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.969
External facts are footnoted
to a primary source,

11
00:00:36.969 --> 00:00:39.325
checked on the day the book was built.

12
00:00:39.325 --> 00:00:43.487
Program positions are the program's
own view, open to argument.

13
00:00:43.487 --> 00:00:46.489
And illustrative examples
are labeled as such;

14
00:00:46.489 --> 00:00:49.799
the case studies are patterns,
not real engagements.

15
00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:54.950
Each chapter also keeps a verification
file, so every correction is visible.

16
00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:56.400
Now, what is the program?
